Z||000000||DJRice||09-28-1999||08:36 PM||||I caught a glimpse of something on a commericial on TV and did a bit of research.  Toyota must think there is something too the mid engine rear drive two seater concept, because the MR2 is back, and it is convertible....<P>IMO, it looks like a large MG, but hey, they are giving it a whirl.  So it looks like we will start seeing these things on the street next year.  But one has to wonder that if the Firebird is slated to be discontinued, Maybe a new Fiero has a chance in the future to appeal to the sports car market, even if it doesnt have a 5.7L engine and a ram air kit.<P><BR>Well, I was going to post the picture I downloaded, but my Image poster is on the fritz....Ill post it later.<BR>||||reg||3
