Z||000006||ChadMan||09-29-1999||08:35 AM||||The new Honda S-2000 is pretty cool. $10 more than the Miata, but 100 more hp...sounds like a fair trade to me.<P>That Toyota is ugly, isn't it?  I read in Road & Track that it was originally going to be named the MR-S (S for Spyder) but their marketing clinics found that men had no interest in driving a "Mrs."  It is supposed to compete head-to-head with the Miata.  I can't wait to pull up next to one at a red light.  Sayonara! ||||reg||1
