Z||000016||ChadMan||10-01-1999||08:55 AM||||Will, I'm sorry, I forgot about the "dealer contribution" which will "affect consumer cost" as any fine print will tell you.  I haven't been to the Honda dealer, but given the gouging that went on with cars like the New Beetle and Prowler, you're probably right.  I bet that gouging won't go on long, though.  $47K?  That's Vette money!<P>But the worst gouging takes place at H-D dealers.  If I really could get an 883 Sporty for $5800 like Cycle World says, I'd probably buy one tomorrow.||||reg||1
